00:12:06.792 --> 00:12:08.226
Oh, God.

00:12:08.226 --> 00:12:11.663
It's like a trough of --

00:12:11.663 --> 00:12:13.465
-I don't --
-No, like a pedestal,

00:12:13.465 --> 00:12:16.602
like, what do you --
Like a bird bath, I guess,

00:12:16.602 --> 00:12:19.738
of actual chili.

00:12:19.738 --> 00:12:21.840
-All right. Those are the first
two things I understood

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.041
that you said. All right.

00:12:23.041 --> 00:12:24.510
Bird bath and chili, all right.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.211
Now we're on my level.
-Devon Sawa, I told you.

00:12:26.211 --> 00:12:27.579
You don't remember Devon Sawa?

00:12:27.579 --> 00:12:28.980
-Devon Sawa is my best roommate.
-He was like a teen dream.

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:30.382
-He was my favorite. What?

00:12:30.382 --> 00:12:31.584
-I mean, I think
it's Devon Sawa.

00:12:31.584 --> 00:12:33.452
Maybe I'm the old one.
I don't know.

00:12:33.452 --> 00:12:36.721
Okay, and then there's, like,
a bird bath of fresh chili

00:12:36.721 --> 00:12:40.992
with freshly grated cheese
and chives and sour cream,

00:12:40.992 --> 00:12:43.862
and then there's a bird.

00:12:43.862 --> 00:12:45.497
-Stop. Stop talking. Stop.
-There's a bird...

00:12:45.497 --> 00:12:47.166
-Stop! Stop talking!
-...with green juice.

00:12:47.166 --> 00:12:49.601
-Stop talking!
Stop it right now!

00:12:49.601 --> 00:12:50.635
-With a Mohawk.

00:12:50.635 --> 00:12:52.071
-'Cause let me
tell you something!

00:12:52.071 --> 00:12:55.874
I would have smelled chili,
if chili was out of that box.

00:12:55.874 --> 00:12:58.910
So -- I'm a detective.

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:03.182
Blake Lively, you lie!

00:13:03.182 --> 00:13:05.351
-Well, let me start
with the chili first.

00:13:05.351 --> 00:13:08.286
[ Laughter ]

00:13:08.286 --> 00:13:10.655
-What? Are you kidding me?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:13:10.655 --> 00:13:13.391
-What? I didn't win.

00:13:13.391 --> 00:13:15.327
-Yes, because it was chili --
-Oh, 'cause I did lie.

00:13:15.327 --> 00:13:17.196
Yeah, I did lie.
-I have no idea.

00:13:17.196 --> 00:13:19.765
Blake Lively, everyone,
is the win--

